          "text": {
            "en": "1622045",
            "zh": "1622045"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Write each hexadecimal digit using four bits, then regroup into groups of three for octal:\n\n$$52326_{16}=0101\\,0010\\,0011\\,0010\\,0110_2=01\\,010\\,010\\,001\\,100\\,100\\,110_2=1221446_8.$$\n\nThe hexadecimal digits 5,2,3,2,6 give `0101 0010 0011 0010 0110`. Starting at the right, make three-bit groups and pad only the leftmost group: `001 010 010 001 100 100 110`. Reading their values yields 1,2,2,1,4,4,6. Hexadecimal digit boundaries need not remain boundaries of the octal groups.\n\n**Answer: B.**",
        "zh": "先将每个十六进制数字写成四位二进制，再每三位一组转换为八进制：\n\n$$52326_{16}=0101\\,0010\\,0011\\,0010\\,0110_2=01\\,010\\,010\\,001\\,100\\,100\\,110_2=1221446_8.$$\n\n十六进制的 5、2、3、2、6 依次给出 `0101 0010 0011 0010 0110`。从最右端每三位分组，只在最左组补 0，得到 `001 010 010 001 100 100 110`，各组值依次为 1、2、2、1、4、4、6。原来的十六进制数字边界不必与新的八进制分组边界重合。\n\n**答案：B。**"
      },
