          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "132",
            "zh": "132"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "First add the two numbers in octal.\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{rccc}\n &  & {\\scriptstyle 1} &  \\\\\n &   & 3 & 6 \\\\\n+ &   & 7 & 4 \\\\\n\\hline\n & 1 & 3 & 2\n\\end{array}\n$$\n\nConvert the sum: $132_8=64+24+2=90_{10}$. Divide by 2 to get the decimal average $45_{10}$ (option C). A separate check is to convert the two inputs to 30 and 60 before averaging.",
        "zh": "先按八进制对齐相加。\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{rccc}\n &  & {\\scriptstyle 1} &  \\\\\n &   & 3 & 6 \\\\\n+ &   & 7 & 4 \\\\\n\\hline\n & 1 & 3 & 2\n\\end{array}\n$$\n\n把和转换成十进制：$132_8=64+24+2=90_{10}$。除以 2 得十进制平均数 $45_{10}$，选 C。也可把两个数分别换成 30 和 60，再求平均核对。"
      },
      "source": {
