    {
      "id": "q3",
      "number": 3,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Recursive Functions",
        "zh": "递归函数"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Find $f(6)$ given:\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\begin{cases} 2 & \\text{if }x=1\\\\ 2\\cdot f(x-1)+1 & \\text{if }x>1 \\end{cases}\n$$",
        "zh": "根据下列表达式,求 $f(6)$ :\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\begin{cases} 2 & x=1\\\\ 2\\cdot f(x-1)+1 & x>1 \\end{cases}\n$$"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "5",
            "zh": "5"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "11",
            "zh": "11"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "23",
            "zh": "23"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "95",
            "zh": "95"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "191",
            "zh": "191"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "D"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "$$\nf(1)=2\n$$\n\n$$\nf(2)=2*f(2-1)+1=2*f(1)+1=2*2+1=5\n$$\n\n$$\nf(3)=2*f(3-1)+1=2*f(2)+1=2*5+1=11\n$$\n\n$$\nf(4)=2*f(4-1)+1=2*f(3)+1=2*11+1=23\n$$\n\n$$\nf(5)=2*f(5-1)+1=2*f(4)+1=2*23+1=47\n$$\n\n$$\nf(6)=2*f(6-1)+1=2*f(5)+1=2*47+1=95\n$$\n\nThe sequence is $2,5,11,23,47,95,\\ldots$; its nth term is $3\\cdot2^{n-1}-1$.\n\n**Answer: D.**",
        "zh": "原卷解析：\n\n$$\nf(1)=2\n$$\n\n$$\nf(2)=2*f(2-1)+1=2*f(1)+1=2*2+1=5\n$$\n\n$$\nf(3)=2*f(3-1)+1=2*f(2)+1=2*5+1=11\n$$\n\n$$\nf(4)=2*f(4-1)+1=2*f(3)+1=2*11+1=23\n$$\n\n$$\nf(5)=2*f(5-1)+1=2*f(4)+1=2*23+1=47\n$$\n\n$$\nf(6)=2*f(6-1)+1=2*f(5)+1=2*47+1=95\n$$\n\n数列为 $2,5,11,23,47,95,\\ldots$，第 $n$ 项可写成 $3\\cdot2^{n-1}-1$。\n\n**答案：D。**"
      },
      "source": {
