    {
      "id": "q4",
      "number": 4,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Recursive Functions",
        "zh": "递归函数"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Find $f(16)$ given:\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\begin{cases} f(x-3)+x & \\text{if }x>10\\\\ 2\\cdot f(x-2) & \\text{if }8\\le x\\le10\\\\ 2x+3 & \\text{if }x<8 \\end{cases}\n$$",
        "zh": "根据下列表达式,求 $f(16)$ :\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\begin{cases} f(x-3)+x & x>10\\\\ 2\\cdot f(x-2) & 8\\le x\\le10\\\\ 2x+3 & x<8 \\end{cases}\n$$"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "73",
            "zh": "73"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "15",
            "zh": "15"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "60",
            "zh": "60"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "30",
            "zh": "30"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "89",
            "zh": "89"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "E"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "$$\nf(16)=f(16-3)+16=f(13)+16=73+16=89\n$$\n\n$$\nf(13)=f(13-3)+13=f(10)+13=60+13=73\n$$\n\n$$\nf(10)=2*f(10-2)=2*f(8)=2*30=60\n$$\n\n$$\nf(8)=2*f(8-2)=2*f(6)=2*15=30\n$$\n\n$$\nf(6)=2*6+3=15\n$$\n\nNow substitute backwards.\n\nThe argument chain is $16\\to13\\to10\\to8\\to6$. Both endpoints 8 and 10 belong to the middle branch, so the base value 15 is doubled twice before adding 13 and 16: $15\\times2\\times2+13+16=89$. The condition is $x<8$ for the base branch, not $x\\le8$.\n\n**Answer: E.**",
        "zh": "原卷解析：\n\n$$\nf(16)=f(16-3)+16=f(13)+16=73+16=89\n$$\n\n$$\nf(13)=f(13-3)+13=f(10)+13=60+13=73\n$$\n\n$$\nf(10)=2*f(10-2)=2*f(8)=2*30=60\n$$\n\n$$\nf(8)=2*f(8-2)=2*f(6)=2*15=30\n$$\n\n$$\nf(6)=2*6+3=15\n$$\n\n从 $f(6)$ 开始向前代回，即得 $f(16)=89$。\n\n参数链为 $16\\to13\\to10\\to8\\to6$。8 与 10 两个端点都属于中间分支，所以基本值 15 要先乘两次 2，再加 13、16：$15\\times2\\times2+13+16=89$。基本分支的条件是 $x<8$，不是 $x\\le8$。\n\n**答案：E。**"
      },
      "source": {
