        "statementPages": [
          1,
          3
        ],
        "solutionSource": "solution",
        "solutionPages": [
          1
        ],
        "answerProvenance": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "q5",
      "number": 5,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "What Does This Program Do?",
        "zh": "程序分析"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Which of the following input values will print “wrong” when executed?\n\n```text\ninput a, b\na = a ^ 2\nb = b ^ 2\nc = a + b\nd = sqrt(c)\nif d == int(d) then\n    output a, b, c\nelse\n    output \"wrong\"\nend if\n```",
        "zh": "以下哪个输入值在执行时会输出“wrong”?\n\n```text\ninput a, b\na = a ^ 2\nb = b ^ 2\nc = a + b\nd = sqrt(c)\nif d == int(d) then\n    output a, b, c\nelse\n    output \"wrong\"\nend if\n```"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "a=3, b=4",
            "zh": "a=3, b=4"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "a=5, b=12",
            "zh": "a=5, b=12"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "a=5, b=10",
            "zh": "a=5, b=10"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "a=9, b=12",
            "zh": "a=9, b=12"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "a=7, b=24",
            "zh": "a=7, b=24"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "For a=5 and b=10, the squared values sum to $25+100=125$, and $\\sqrt{125}\\approx11.18$ is not an integer. That input prints `wrong`. The other input pairs are the legs of the Pythagorean triples 3–4–5, 5–12–13, 9–12–15 and 7–24–25.\n\nThe condition asks whether the positive square root is an integer. The five squared sums are $25,169,125,225,625$. Four are perfect squares: $5^2,13^2,15^2,25^2$. For the remaining 125, $11^2<125<12^2$, so d differs from its integer part and selects the `else` output.\n\n**Answer: C.**",
        "zh": "当 a=5、b=10 时，平方和为 $25+100=125$，$\\sqrt{125}\\approx11.18$ 不是整数，因此输出 `wrong`。其余输入对应勾股数组 3–4–5、5–12–13、9–12–15、7–24–25。\n\n条件检查的是正平方根是否为整数。五个输入的平方和依次为 $25,169,125,225,625$；其中四个分别是 $5^2,13^2,15^2,25^2$。剩余的 125 满足 $11^2<125<12^2$，因此 d 不等于它的整数部分，进入输出 `wrong` 的分支。\n\n**答案：C。**"
      },
