    {
      "id": "q6",
      "number": 6,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "What Does This Program Do?",
        "zh": "程序分析"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Run the following program with each number from 1 to 25, inclusive. How many of them are output?\n\n```text\ninput num\nif num % 3 == 0 && num % 4 == 0 then\n    output num\nend if\nif num % 5 == 0 || num % 7 == 0 then\n    output num\nend if\n```",
        "zh": "用1到25之间的每个数字(含首尾)依次运行以下程序,最终会输出多少个数字?\n\n```text\ninput num\nif num % 3 == 0 && num % 4 == 0 then\n    output num\nend if\nif num % 5 == 0 || num % 7 == 0 then\n    output num\nend if\n```"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "11",
            "zh": "11"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "10",
            "zh": "10"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "9",
            "zh": "9"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "8",
            "zh": "8"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "7",
            "zh": "7"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "From 1 through 25, the numbers divisible by both 3 and 4 are 12 and 24. The numbers divisible by 5 or 7 are 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, 7, 14 and 21. These groups are disjoint, so there are 2+8=10 outputs.\n\nThe first `&&` requires multiples of $\\operatorname{lcm}(3,4)=12$, yielding two numbers. The second `||` accepts the union of multiples of 5 and 7: five plus three numbers; their first common multiple 35 is outside the range. These are two independent `if` statements, but neither 12 nor 24 satisfies the second, so no input is printed twice here.\n\n**Answer: B.**",
        "zh": "1 到 25 中，同时被 3 和 4 整除的数是 12、24；被 5 或 7 整除的数是 5、10、15、20、25、7、14、21。两组没有重复，因此一共输出 2+8=10 个数。\n\n第一个 `&&` 要求同时满足两个整除条件，即 12 的倍数，共两个。第二个 `||` 取 5 的倍数与 7 的倍数的并集，共五个加三个；二者最小公倍数 35 超出范围，内部没有重复。虽然这是两个独立的 `if`，但 12、24 都不满足第二条件，因此本题没有某个输入被输出两次。\n\n**答案：B。**"
      },
